  "description": "Roslyn analyzer for C# readability. CCCRC001 flags a return expression that exceeds ReturnTypeComplexityAnalyzerMaximum calculation steps (default 1). Arithmetic other than string concatenation, method calls other than nameof, and conditional operators each count as one step. Default severity is warning.",
