  "releaseNotes": "0.1 (2026-10-07)\n\n - Initial release.\n - CCCRC001 flags a return expression whose calculation-step score exceeds ReturnTypeComplexityAnalyzerMaximum (default 1).\n - String concatenation and nameof do not count. One arithmetic operator, one method call, or one conditional is allowed at the default.\n - Default severity is warning; set warning, error, message, or off.",
